    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]The rules are simple as could be. First you run, then you ride, and finally you swim!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "The rules are simple as could be. First you run, then you ride, and finally you swim!"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Obstructing competitors? No problem! As long as one of your teammates finishes, you pass!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "Obstructing competitors? No problem! As long as one of your teammates finishes, you pass!"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Shortcuts are fair game, but careful of who's lying within the alleys! They're not gonna roll over and let you through!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "Shortcuts are fair game, but careful of who's lying within the alleys! They're not gonna roll over and let you through!"
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Furthermore, if you reach the finish, but the cycling and swimming checkpoints never saw you, then that's not gonna count!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "Furthermore, if you reach the finish, but the cycling and swimming checkpoints never saw you, then that's not gonna count!"
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]In other words, contestants, nothing's stopping you from spinning around and diving in at the start line—if you wanna be the laughing stock of the whole city.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "In other words, contestants, nothing's stopping you from spinning around and diving in at the start line—if you wanna be the laughing stock of the whole city."
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]If you're someone who's got it made and you wanna hitch on a low-altitude aircraft, sure!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "If you're someone who's got it made and you wanna hitch on a low-altitude aircraft, sure!"
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]But, if the audience doesn't like that, you might just get booted out at the votes!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "But, if the audience doesn't like that, you might just get booted out at the votes!"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Further, as fifteen teams directly passed Round 1, along with one team being revived thanks to audience voting, sixteen teams in total made it out.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "Further, as fifteen teams directly passed Round 1, along with one team being revived thanks to audience voting, sixteen teams in total made it out."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Thus, eight teams will pass Round 2.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "Thus, eight teams will pass Round 2."
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]That's the first eight teams to make it who get the right to pass!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "D.D.D.",
        "content": "That's the first eight teams to make it who get the right to pass!"
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[name=\"D.D.D.\"]Well, then, let's invite those sixteen teams up onto the stage!",
        "type": "dialog",
