        "raw": "[name=\"Eyjafjalla\"]No, I came voluntarily to carry out geological research, and if I hold up everyone else...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Eyjafjalla",
        "content": "No, I came voluntarily to carry out geological research, and if I hold up everyone else..."
